      en: ["Located in the Tete Province of northwestern Mozambique.", "Belongs geologically to the Angónia Highlands.", "Composed mainly of gneiss and granitic rocks.", "Reaches an elevation of over 1100 meters.", "Important water catchment area for regional rivers.", "Home to rare species of montane orchids."],
